</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">Time series</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Not available for this subcategory</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">Update frequency</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Annually</td>
</tr>
<tr>
